# Generated by a run, not written by hand — all of it is reproducible with the
# commands in README.md / vision/REPORT.md, and together it is ~60 MB that would
# sit in git history forever.
#
#   outputs/  per-run pipeline results (gzipped model output, timings, events)
#   raw/      provider wire logs, server logs, orchestrator/judge logs, job specs
#   build/    the esbuild bundle of the production modules under test
#
# The harness, corpus, fact sheets, scored results and reports ARE tracked, so
# the method and the conclusions stay reviewable without the bulk.
outputs/
raw/
build/
